{"server":"tw","storyId":"act9mini_level_act9mini_st02","groupId":"act9mini","stageId":null,"title":"落灰","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9mini/level_act9mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"76f4dcabc684aa09638e0f5d3793263656c3106ee4f74b6cc3290895b1371b13","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔1.5-灰松鼠"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，我們要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還沒到你提問的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿穩小炮，跟緊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那邊是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"競技場，從大騎士領來的傢伙們建的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是要去看比賽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比賽？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要帶你去參加訓練。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還記得我教你的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，奶奶，我記得很清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"架盾、起炮、轟擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盯緊敵人、注意彈藥、炮不離手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"炮聲轟鳴，勝利已在眼前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你比你的父親要可靠得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至少在我閉上眼前，還有人能夠記得這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，請別說這樣的喪氣話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，古木哪有不爛的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"與其就這麼腐朽掉，不如做新芽的肥料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必，只是咳嗽一下，沒什麼好擔心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你父親那一輩，甚至我的幾位兄弟，早都忘了卡利斯卡是怎麼繁榮的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"林業？那片林子是我們靠功勳、靠火炮換回來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“炮聲轟鳴，勝利已在眼前”......那幫見錢眼開的傢伙連格言都記不住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，請您別生氣了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂，你是棵好苗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可別長歪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，我不會讓您失望的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沸血騎士團——競技場屠夫——養好傷後再度歸來——一如既往的殘暴！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而另一邊——另一邊是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威嚴的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"曾經的南方林業鉅子——卡利斯卡集團的一員——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今則是一位感染者——隸屬於紅松騎士團——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們歡迎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......放輕鬆，奶奶已經教會我了，我可以的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我準備好了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫騎士，格蕾納蒂·卡利斯卡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，小灰終於進場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂進場總是慢悠悠的，也不和觀眾表示一下，一點都不痛快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是賣點嘛，有人可喜歡這一套了，你看那。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的粉絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂！格蕾納蒂看我一眼呀！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡呼聲作不了假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且那個持炮的姿勢，還挺像貴族的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然我最期待的還是她開炮轟人的時候啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那是肯定有的啦，聽到轟隆隆的響聲觀眾可興奮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有更過癮的就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你還想看她用炮筒砸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，有機會還真想見識一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"巨斧對堅盾！究竟誰才是最後的贏家，讓我們拭目以待！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"點開您的終端，做出您的選擇，支持您的選手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"當然更重要的是，給自己一個填滿錢包的機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"比賽——開始——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上那塊塑膠最好能多撐一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病垃圾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒勁，上了賽場就話都不多說一句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不是第一次看小灰比賽，那叫認真，認真懂不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這樣很無聊啊......不發洩一下情緒，怎麼在氣勢上壓過對手哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士競技又不是誰嗓門大誰贏呀，主要是對抗得好看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"看嘛，就是這樣的。鏽銅被逼退了，大家也都很高興，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是今天這場，是不是太穩了？連主動攻擊都很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"這也得挑對手嘛，遇上鏽銅這種偏重進攻的騎士，組織好防禦才是最佳策略。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"而且小灰又能用她最愛的技巧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"盾擊擋開接一炮，百試不爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（小灰這一場進攻欲望是不太強，她到底在想什麼啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"令人驚訝，屠夫的切肉斧在灰毫騎士面前居然毫無辦法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次格擋，每一發炮擊都讓英格拉無功而返！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫騎士的防禦完美無缺，她正在一點點推進，壓縮屬於屠夫的活動空間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無疑問，這將是一場拉鋸戰，不到最後一刻，誰都不知道勝利的桂冠花落誰家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊拿起終端為您支援的選手下注吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"抑或是即刻訂購一瓶印有選手logo的賽場特供冰鎮礦泉水，讓身旁的觀眾知道您到底支持哪一方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"現在下單，立刻有專人為您送至座位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這種東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"真的有，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這價格......我為什麼不去賽場外面買十瓶回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會下單了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"就買一瓶嘗嘗鮮，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你就只會縮在那塑膠板後面嗎，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"喝，等我敲碎它，你有的是時間尖叫，石頭老鼠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利斯卡這樣的小企業是不會給你收屍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（扣下扳機）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，小灰生氣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉也太毒了吧，揪著人痛點不放幹嘛呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利斯卡林業以前還是挺有名氣的，最近倒是聽不到什麼新聞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會真的和格蕾納蒂有關吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"要真讓小灰來經營，他們家的公司說不定現在還能做大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"自己經營不善，就把氣撒在別人頭上，這樣的公司肯定做不好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說小灰是在一桌子叔父叔母面前被全體表決逐出家族的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"全票通過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她父母......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說也被要脅著把自己的女兒投出家族了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然回家以後還是給小灰準備了來大騎士領的資金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也應該知道吧，本應該支持自己的父母都舉起了手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"太痛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"還好小灰夠堅強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"特別堅強。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......她不會真生氣了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"還好還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候生氣不是很正常的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我肯定先把鏽銅捅個對穿再考慮其他問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰的打法太耗腦子了，彈藥數量又有限，賭氣多打一發彈藥可能就輸了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"現在應該還在讓鏽銅以為自己生氣了的階段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，誤導對手也是很重要的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"令人震驚，英格拉的肩甲居然被轟碎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫騎士仍舊在步步緊逼，難道勝負馬上就要揭曉了嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"又是一聲炮響，看來灰毫騎士已經準備好親手拉響勝利的禮炮了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？！各位觀眾看到了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛鏽銅居然用斧頭劈開了一枚炮彈！感謝兩位選手，為我們上演了一出在電視劇集中才能見到的場面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我說的正是斯沃瑪影片投資拍攝的都市懸疑電視劇《大騎士領二十四夜》中的經典場景，有興趣的觀眾可以立即下單購買光碟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"前三十名購入者可以獲得男女主角簽名海報一張，先到先得，逾時不候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"咕咚咕咚——呼，這水和路邊便利店買的也沒什麼區別嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是早提醒過你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，算啦，就當付了筆代購費吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，莫布還真是不放過每一個能做廣告的機會啊，真煩人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是他的工作嘛，理解一下啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不過誰能想到鏽銅會斧劈炮彈呢，硬生生給了莫布一個插廣告的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是那一下小灰心軟了，想著把鏽銅轟倒，就沒瞄準腦袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"比賽現在就結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她彈匣裡炮彈不多了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"應該只剩一發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"該換彈匣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"希望英格拉別在這時候給我們家小灰添什麼麻煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有一發嗎。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（把他轟退的同時借力後撤，爭取到的時間應該足夠。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（以英格拉的競賽風格，應該不會有後手。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（時機差不多了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這點本事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（變快了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（不好！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏽銅鞋子上那是，推進器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"這一下可麻煩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"加油啊小灰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"沒了炮彈，你還能做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰，你還有彈藥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，備用彈匣剛剛用來擋弩箭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼辦，用炮筒砸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"有需要的話我可以分心幫你對付幾個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"然後像之前那樣乘機拿走我的分數？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"別再惦記那件事啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"當初大家初次見面，沒有提防才有問題啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"以後不會了，我們約定過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我能相信格蕾納蒂不會為了自己的利益犧牲其他感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂也相信索娜不會背後捅她刀子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"對不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那你準備怎麼對付面前的騎士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的能騰出空來幫一把的，有需要就趕緊說哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我有我的辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛還佔據優勢的灰毫騎士在換彈時被抓住破綻，鏽銅開始了復仇，難道屠夫的切肉斧終究還是要見血了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫騎士究竟會如何反擊呢，我們看到她——她拆下空彈匣甩向鏽銅，然而沒有任何——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"哦不對，她甚至丟下了炮衝向鏽銅，她到底要做什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉舉起了武器，灰毫騎士卻只剩一面盾牌！灰毫——灰毫格開了戰斧，然後——喔！！一擊頭槌，連我這裡都聽得到響聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"喔！一套連貫的徒手打擊，英格拉後退了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂一個翻滾回到了她的武器旁，換彈，上膛，一氣呵成！英格拉又要再次被炮火支配了嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，我們又一次聽到了炮響，灰毫騎士重新掌握了局面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然難看了點......這脫身方法還挺實用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我真的沒想到她丟下那門炮之後速度會那麼快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰也是札拉克嘛，靈活一點很正常的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她為什麼不和你一樣用輕巧點的武器呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"個人愛好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我是建議過她換件更適合在賽場上使用的遠程武器，標槍啊、弩啦、投石索之類的，她都不喜歡，就是愛用那門從老家帶來的炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候根本施展不開，維護還費時費力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是固執。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剩下的彈藥就只有最後八發了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果打完了會發生什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道欸，會發生什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我是從來沒見過小灰把備彈全部打完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，呼，你是在羞辱我嗎，灰毫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"說話啊，你這個，石頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（扣下扳機）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你準備裝啞巴到什麼時候！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"受夠了，我受夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰真的太壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不會從一開始就準備和英格拉玩拉鋸戰的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又不回話又打不倒，換我我也氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，你來啦查絲汀娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫她為什麼要羞辱鏽銅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，說來話就長啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我碰見小灰的時候，她就對觀眾席上面的騎士老爺們一肚子怒火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的感染者騎士都覺得她只是單純地對騎士老爺不滿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但是她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有感染的話，她也是騎士貴族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我聽說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"在受到感染後，她騎士家族的長輩同輩沒有一個人對她表示過同情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都將家族的逐漸衰落歸咎在她身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正常人都知道這和得病沒關係啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們就這樣做了，她的家族，卡利斯卡的札拉克們一致同意剝奪小灰的地位，把她踢出家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰曾經是那麼信賴這些親屬，願意與他們分享趣事，願意同他們切磋武藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但最後，小灰以為的至親好友，一位都沒伸出援手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說還有人恨不得讓她徹底從大地上消失——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，不至於吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那天我也在，幫小灰擋了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應該能理解小灰為什麼對騎士老爺們深惡痛絕了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"至於鏽銅英格拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"他所做的每一件事，都在深深刺痛小灰的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是這個原因，小灰才準備在拉鋸戰中對抗到最後吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"為了將一位高高在上的騎士老爺徹底打倒在地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也為了......平息她自己的憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，查絲汀娜，幫我看看小灰彈匣裡還有幾發炮彈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......四發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"噢哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"快要結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"一陣猛烈的攻勢並沒有擊倒灰毫騎士，鏽銅卻開始體力不支了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能看到他正準備發起最後的衝鋒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"漫長的拉鋸戰馬上就能見分曉了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"請各位觀眾注意您的投注號碼，說不定在勝負見分曉的同時，還能獲得一份意外大禮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"本場賽後幸運抽獎由呼嘯守衛贊助，機率竟然是驚人的百分之零點五！還沒有下注的觀眾，請抓住這最後的機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉舉起了他的屠刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂也擺出了一個防禦姿態！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"勝負馬上就要見分曉了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，小灰她什麼時候偷學我的招！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"鏽銅在衝鋒，鏽銅還在衝鋒，灰毫也舉起盾牌，卻把炮口對準了身後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"難道她要硬接下鏽銅一擊嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"雙方越來越近，越來越近了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"借著炮擊的加速度，灰毫居然從鏽銅的斧旁躥了過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"太快了太快了！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"她捨棄了盾牌，把炮口按在英格拉後背上扣動了扳機！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"鏽銅騎士倒下了！灰毫騎士獲得了勝利！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，灰毫騎士又一次把炮口對準了鏽銅，難道，殘虐的英格拉也有被欺凌的一天嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，縮在殼裡的札拉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫......格蕾納蒂......我記住......你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"等我養好傷......你......你們感染者，一個都逃不掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（扣住扳機）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（將炮口對準天空）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"這一枚炮彈是獻給觀眾的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你不配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你......嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫騎士最終沒有攻擊倒下的英格拉，在打出最後一發炮彈後，她獨自一人走向了出口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的粉絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂！格蕾納蒂——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本次比賽——抽獎——獎金——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一次感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是很好，父親，火炮拿久了手還是會抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不要換一件更輕便的武器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用，火炮很適合我，它的威力能夠補足靈活性上的不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，或許某一天，我將不在賽場，而是到更廣闊的地方作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像祖母那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那個時候，這件武器一定會變得更加實用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小堅果啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父親，我不是小孩子了，您沒有必要這樣稱呼我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這次訓練做得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶如果看到你現在的成果，一定會開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶走之前和幾位大伯做過約定，只要你想學，他們就會繼續資助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以不用擔心錢的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論你最終成為騎士還是繼承家業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"繼續練習下去，總有一天，你會成為卡西米爾知名的火炮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，卡利斯卡家已經多少代沒有出過一名真正的火炮手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想必各位長輩和祖輩都會為你而驕傲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可不要讓他們失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成長的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，小灰，小灰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼突然開始發呆了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，在想些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉可真慘，剛從醫院出來就又被你送回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"他罪有應得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那最後一發還往天上打？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"比賽已經結束了，就算我再看不起英格拉，也不能再對他下手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不然我和他又有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了，本來還想在報紙上看到“屠夫慘遭屠戮”之類的標題來著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉家族讓這則新聞上不了報紙的可能性比較大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜，其實我從剛才就想問你個問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，怎麼了小灰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上拿著的，是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你的應援水瓶啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜你怎麼又買這種無聊的東西了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"還好啦，主要是那時候有點口渴又懶得出去買水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，我們的騎士凱旋啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也要向灰毫學習，變得更強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜，“那件事”怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"好，辛苦辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"這次的獎金一到帳我就會匯去“那個帳號”，聽說銀行那邊已經開始關注最近的頻繁轉帳問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"還能用個人消費糊弄一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"留給我們的時間，不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在還沒到考慮這個的時候啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我們先去慶祝一下吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
